# i18n & content

- Same key in `i18n/de.ts` **and** `en.ts`
- Content stays typed, I/O-free, no `@adv/*` imports
- Keep content IDs stable if referenced from saves
- Gate: `node tools/gates/i18n-keys.mjs`

Skills: `safe-ui-patch` (copy), `.agents/skills/i18n-content`.
